  m_Name: Aljaz
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Musketeers.Data::Musketeers.Data.CharacterDef
  Id: aljaz
  DisplayName: "Alja\u017E"
  Color: {r: 0.27, g: 0.55, b: 1, a: 1}
  Ability: 2
  AbilityName: Triple Charge
  AbilityDescription: Fire 3 shots down one line (5 tiles). Each hit deals 1 damage and knocks back 1 tile, so up to 3 damage and 3 tiles of knockback. A Parry reflects them. Needs a loaded musket.
  Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 58f165eb181354f75b00c3bb0e7354d3, type: 3}
  Title: The Quickdraw
  Strength: Finger speed
  Weakness: On a leash
  Bio: 'There was a time when Aljaž was the first man into battle. These days, he''s more reserved when lunging into combat. Instead, he''s the first to make sure everyone knows exactly when and where it''s happening. His wife expects him home by supper, and even the King''s orders won''t change that. Beloved by guards and tavern keepers alike, he believes his lightning-fast musician''s fingers and impeccable reputation make him the rightful commander of the Musketeers.'
  SignatureText: Fire 3 shots down one line (5 tiles). Each hit deals 1 damage and knocks back 1 tile, so up to 3 damage and 3 tiles of knockback. A Parry reflects them. Needs a loaded musket.
